haels and got a hole punture and some ribbon and tied them on...","Attachments":[],"Id":599402,"PostDate":1235235057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>PM.Wedding<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi everyone!<br \/> <br \/> Can anyone help with a unique idea for wedding favors?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Don't know if it's unique UNIQUE but it worked for us... <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> We did favors that doubled as place cards too... <br \/> <br \/> I ordered glass starfish from favorsandflowers.com, link is below:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.favorsandflowers.com\/starfish-glass-paperweight-favor.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Starfish Glass Paperweight Favor<\/a><br \/> <br \/> and than I ordered personalized favor tags with each person's full name and Table ______ underneath from them too! <br \/> <br \/> I just went to michaels and got a hole punture and some ribbon and tied them on...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Luggage Tags, Travel Brochures and Passport Size Itinerary Forum<\/strong><span>:<\/span>