{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":150216,"Title":"liked a post you made in Any Gran Bahia Principe Run...","Message":"Hello!\n\nJasminMattPhoto just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHello Ladies!!\n \nCongrats to all of you who have said \"I Do\" and Congrats to all of you in the process of planning!\nI have started my pre-planning early as I am not getting married until May 2018.  We have guests we would like to join us but need a bit of extra time...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/44634-any-gran-bahia-principe-runaway-bay-brides-out-there\/?view=findpost&p=1914911\n","Sender":{"Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1468929380,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":150199,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"bellabride2018,\n\nTD2018 has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Hi there!\".\n\nTD2018 said:\n======================================================================\nHi! I saw you were getting married in 2018, and I was wondering if and how you've gone about your save the dates. I am also getting married in 2018 and doing a type of destination wedding (a cruise) and was looking for some advice and ideas from anyone that's doing something similar! Thanks in advance and congratulations!!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=13948#msg24113\n","Sender":{"Id":287385,"Name":"TD2018","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1468895022,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":13948}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"2","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
