ras as you need. I had my wedding there last month, and had the \"free\" package and added everything as extra because no matter what package you want, if you want to modify something, they will charge you an arm and a leg for everything, so i found it more worth it to take everything individually. I had the buffet as well, and had a private area at the beach, we had the free open bar for the first 3 hours as they offer, and the last hour was only 3 cocktails so it came out to a lot less. However, they still gave us the full open bar for that last hour even though we paid for less, cause i think they didnt want to bother putting bottles away hehe&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914727,"PostDate":1467828973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would say go with the free package and add as many extras as you need. I had my wedding there last month, and had the \"free\" package and added everything as extra because no matter what package you want, if you want to modify something, they will charge you an arm and a leg for everything, so i found it more worth it to take everything individually. I had the buffet as well, and had a private area at the beach, we had the free open bar for the first 3 hours as they offer, and the last hour was only 3 cocktails so it came out to a lot less. However, they still gave us the full open bar for that last hour even though we paid for less, cause i think they didnt want to bother putting bottles away hehe<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"talia_molina@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"144.172.152.124","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444345647,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"taminic","Id":285050,"Name":"taminic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.242.129.156","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd8bcfd1d417cf39f8d0869b46e05d55","RawContent":"Thank you @[member=\"taminic\"]\n@[member=\"taminic\"]\n\nDid you get your hair done at the spa? Was your ceremony at the beach or gazebo? We are getting married on the beach, and I am really hoping to go barefoot but I know the sand isn&#039;t the best.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914729,"PostDate":1467831700,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285050\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285050-taminic\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">taminic<\/span><\/a><br \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285050\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285050-taminic\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">taminic<\/span><\/a><br>\nDid you get your hair done at the spa? Was your ceremony at the beach or gazebo? We are getting married on the beach, and I am really hoping to go barefoot but I know the sand isn't the best.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nic_melt@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.172.45.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453204037,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nicmelt","Id":285957,"Name":"Nicmelt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.131.69.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eef4b03b6782b2d0643075798af6c31a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;no problem! and yes i did, i got my hair and makeup done and absolutely loved it! i booked the appointment for my bridesmaids and i before arriving though! u just have to send them an email ;) they&#039;ll offer you the trial, which i didnt take but thats up to you. I wanted beach waves with half a pony tail so i didnt think paying a trial for that was worth it since it wasnt an updo.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My ceremony was at the beach and it was wonderful! everyone wore flats and i wore a pair of cute flat silver sandals with a bow on it...the only reason i couldnt go barefoot even though i wanted to, was because my wedding was at 2pm so the sand would have been way too hot! i hope this helps :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914740,"PostDate":1467892541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>no problem! and yes i did, i got my hair and makeup done and absolutely loved it! i booked the appointment for my bridesmaids and i before arriving though! u just have to send them an email <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> they'll offer you the trial, which i didnt take but thats up to you. I wanted beach waves with half a pony tail so i didnt think paying a trial for that was worth it since it wasnt an updo.<\/p>\n<p>My ceremony was at the beach and it was wonderful! everyone wore flats and i wore a pair of cute flat silver sandals with a bow on it...the only reason i couldnt go barefoot even though i wanted to, was because my wedding was at 2pm so the sand would have been way too hot! i hope this helps <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"talia_molina@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"144.172.152.124","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444345647,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"taminic","Id":285050,"Name":"taminic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.199.65.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75b88f848da8b3940e3818925cbce2d4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For any brides getting married at Grand Bahia Runaway Bay. We were JUST there a few weeks ago. We photographed a wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay but I also look a bunch of photos of the grounds at Grand Bahia.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Check out the gallery here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18226]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Feel free to ask us any about the resort and we&#039;d be happy to help as much as we can &amp;lt;#&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914747,"PostDate":1467912833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>For any brides getting married at Grand Bahia Runaway Bay. We were JUST there a few weeks ago. We photographed a wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay but I also look a bunch of photos of the grounds at Grand Bahia.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Check out the gallery here:<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18226-grand-bahia-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18226\/tn_gallery_287055_18226_1389495.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='Grand Bahia Jamaica 016'  width='75' height='75'  alt='Grand Bahia Jamaica 016' id='tn_image_view_84171_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18226-grand-bahia-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Grand Bahia Jamaica<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>32 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Feel free to ask us any about the resort and we'd be happy to help as much as we can <#<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>Read our testimonials of appreciation from previous couples<\/a>\u00a0<3<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Rated 5 out of 5 stars on Facebook. <strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Check us out!<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464777939,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.35.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0ecf90200697e19435b7c3eb593cd7d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats to all of you who have said \"I Do\" and Congrats to all of you in the process of planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have started my pre-planning early as I am not getting married until May 2018.&amp;nbsp; We have guests we would like to join us but need a bit of extra time in order to save.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All of the information I have read has been so helpful and informative and I appreciate your sharing.&amp;nbsp; I have a TA already and she is working on pricing for flights and stay.&amp;nbsp; I have quite a few questions that I am hoping everyone will be able to help me with as my FI and I are paying for this ourselves and would like to have the money (or most of it all saved before hand).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1.&amp;nbsp; How did you contact the resort to notify them you were planning to get married there?&amp;nbsp; Was the initial contact through the TA?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2.&amp;nbsp; Does anyone have approximate wedding package prices?&amp;nbsp; I have copies of the packages but it does not list any pricing.&amp;nbsp; We could be looking at around 35-45 people and want a little bit of a handle on what we could be looking at for price.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3.&amp;nbsp; Everything I read lists different documentation that is required.&amp;nbsp; What is it that we will actually need to send, take with us and have notarized?&amp;nbsp; (I am from Ontario Canada)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am so very excited and I have a long way to go... about 1 year, 10 months...lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you so very much!&amp;nbsp; I appreciate all of your comments and ideas!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914911,"PostDate":1468871177,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats to all of you who have said \"I Do\" and Congrats to all of you in the process of planning!<\/p>\n<p>I have started my pre-planning early as I am not getting married until May 2018.\u00a0 We have guests we would like to join us but need a bit of extra time in order to save.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All of the information I have read has been so helpful and informative and I appreciate your sharing.\u00a0 I have a TA already and she is working on pricing for flights and stay.\u00a0 I have quite a few questions that I am hoping everyone will be able to help me with as my FI and I are paying for this ourselves and would like to have the money (or most of it all saved before hand).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1.\u00a0 How did you contact the resort to notify them you were planning to get married there?\u00a0 Was the initial contact through the TA?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2.\u00a0 Does anyone have approximate wedding package prices?\u00a0 I have copies of the packages but it does not list any pricing.\u00a0 We could be looking at around 35-45 people and want a little bit of a handle on what we could be looking at for price.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3.\u00a0 Everything I read lists different documentation that is required.\u00a0 What is it that we will actually need to send, take with us and have notarized?\u00a0 (I am from Ontario Canada)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so very excited and I have a long way to go... about 1 year, 10 months...lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so very much!\u00a0 I appreciate all of your comments and ideas!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mmcallister_80@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.227.35.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1468360524,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"bellabride2018","Id":287346,"Name":"bellabride2018","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"44634","Title":"Any Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay Brides out there?","LastPostDate":1468871177},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5565,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":5560,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":5550,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
