Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.247.243.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a294466810520ab4ca6517642b9bd6f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TorontoGal\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For the private reception, I meant, for the open bar, if it would be better to get the romance package in conjunction with the private reception, or do the free package with the private reception and pay for the open bar. Forgot to mention the bar part! haha&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910032,"PostDate":1453754673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285713\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285713-torontogal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TorontoGal<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the private reception, I meant, for the open bar, if it would be better to get the romance package in conjunction with the private reception, or do the free package with the private reception and pay for the open bar. Forgot to mention the bar part! haha\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittnoel448@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.247.243.11","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1437401092,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hydewedding","Id":284045,"Name":"Hydewedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.152.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6724a5b25693ea0d4a372c2d614fb16c","RawContent":":) \nI think it depends on the number of people you have attending, and the kind of bar you want (international $$$ vs domestic $$ vs cocktails $). \n\nAre you adding a steel drum band, cocktails after ceremony, champagne? These are not included in the free package. Also I think the free package has a limit of 16 people- after which you pay a price per person. The romance package includes 30 people. \n\n\n[quote name=\"Hydewedding\" post=\"1910032\" timestamp=\"1453772673\"]\n@[member=\"TorontoGal\"]\n\nThanks!\n\nFor the private reception, I meant, for the open bar, if it would be better to get the romance package in conjunction with the private reception, or do the free package with the private reception and pay for the open bar. Forgot to mention the bar part! haha[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1910034,"PostDate":1453755521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think it depends on the number of people you have attending, and the kind of bar you want (international $$$ vs domestic $$ vs cocktails $).\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you adding a steel drum band, cocktails after ceremony, champagne? These are not included in the free package. Also I think the free package has a limit of 16 people- after which you pay a price per person. The romance package includes 30 people.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Hydewedding, on 25 January 2016 - 08:44 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285713\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285713-torontogal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TorontoGal<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the private reception, I meant, for the open bar, if it would be better to get the romance package in conjunction with the private reception, or do the free package with the private reception and pay for the open bar. Forgot to mention the bar part! haha\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"arij.alchawaf@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.233.152.139","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1451352594,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TorontoGal","Id":285713,"Name":"TorontoGal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.247.243.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb5355b2f0f073acc7443e95d2b429c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TorontoGal\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think we will have between 40-50 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am not sure what type of bar we want. Just weighing the pros and cons of which package we want to go with. We don&#039;t need most of the extras in the Romance package, we don&#039;t need any of the photos, the return visit, the spa discount, but on the other hand we like the free open bar, the cocktails reception after the ceremony and the later ceremony times. Such a hard decision!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The free wedding has a minimum of 16 people, then you pay $30USD for everyone after 30.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910036,"PostDate":1453756054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285713\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285713-torontogal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TorontoGal<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think we will have between 40-50 people.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am not sure what type of bar we want. Just weighing the pros and cons of which package we want to go with. We don't need most of the extras in the Romance package, we don't need any of the photos, the return visit, the spa discount, but on the other hand we like the free open bar, the cocktails reception after the ceremony and the later ceremony times. Such a hard decision!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The free wedding has a minimum of 16 people, then you pay $30USD for everyone after 30.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittnoel448@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.247.243.11","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1437401092,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hydewedding","Id":284045,"Name":"Hydewedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.247.243.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63473a804e1c8f9de73645d209444039","RawContent":"Did anyone not book their wedding day three business days in advance of when they arrived? \n\nWe arrive on Saturday and really don&#039;t want to wait (sun burns, hangovers, stress) until Thursday to get married. \n\nI have emailed the resort to try and change it, which I need to know this week to book my photographer. Any advice?\n\nThanks! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1910441,"PostDate":1454441216,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Did anyone not book their wedding day three business days in advance of when they arrived? <br>\nWe arrive on Saturday and really don't want to wait (sun burns, hangovers, stress) until Thursday to get married. <br>\nI have emailed the resort to try and change it, which I need to know this week to book my photographer. Any advice?<br>\nThanks! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittnoel448@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.247.243.11","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1437401092,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hydewedding","Id":284045,"Name":"Hydewedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.181.193.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d80fc0d2ec3c40b51f5a6b5646434c3d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Hydewedding\" post=\"1910441\" timestamp=\"1454459216\"]\nDid anyone not book their wedding day three business days in advance of when they arrived? \nWe arrive on Saturday and really don&#039;t want to wait (sun burns, hangovers, stress) until Thursday to get married. \nI have emailed the resort to try and change it, which I need to know this week to book my photographer. Any advice?\nThanks! \nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nWe arrive on a Thursday and are having our wedding on the following Tuesday. It is not technically 3 business days but the hotel didn&#039;t say anything so I assume it&#039;s fine. \n\nNot sure if you are aware of the charge to bring in an outside photographer, $900USD.","Attachments":[],"Id":1910442,"PostDate":1454443014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Hydewedding, on 02 February 2016 - 07:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Did anyone not book their wedding day three business days in advance of when they arrived? <br>\nWe arrive on Saturday and really don't want to wait (sun burns, hangovers, stress) until Thursday to get married. <br>\nI have emailed the resort to try and change it, which I need to know this week to book my photographer. Any advice?<br>\nThanks! <br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nWe arrive on a Thursday and are having our wedding on the following Tuesday. It is not technically 3 business days but the hotel didn't say anything so I assume it's fine. <br><br>\nNot sure if you are aware of the charge to bring in an outside photographer, $900USD.  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sweetie_pie_06_18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.181.193.111","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452861563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285911.jpg?_r=1462160218","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Rosalyn","Id":285911,"Name":"Rosalyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.247.243.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7563443c091717c3349c0656c03878b5","RawContent":"Thanks! If the photographer is a guest it is $500usd. These vendor fees are crazy! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1910443,"PostDate":1454443115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks! If the photographer is a guest it is $500usd. These vendor fees are crazy! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittnoel448@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.247.243.11","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1437401092,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hydewedding","Id":284045,"Name":"Hydewedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.247.128.186","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be44592b22d168262a2b5c1c0051f16e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi all, first time poster and hoping those who have recently had their wedding or are still planning can help answer some questions that I can&#039;t seem to find answers to regarding the prices&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Do the packages not include bridesmaid flowers? Does anyone know how much these cost?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Decorations for the gazebo - again, cost for this?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Did anyone find that 80 photos from the photographer was inadequate? What did it cost for more?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- For Private restaurant, what exactly is included for $2500? My understanding from reading some old posts is:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dinner&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Open bar for 2 hours&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Private Venue&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Decorations for venue&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;DJ\/Music\/Microphone for speeches????&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What is the max # of people included for 2500$ is it 40??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;THANK YOU IN ADVANCE :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910914,"PostDate":1455582537,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi all, first time poster and hoping those who have recently had their wedding or are still planning can help answer some questions that I can't seem to find answers to regarding the prices<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- Do the packages not include bridesmaid flowers? Does anyone know how much these cost?<\/p>\n<p>- Decorations for the gazebo - again, cost for this?<\/p>\n<p>- Did anyone find that 80 photos from the photographer was inadequate? What did it cost for more?<\/p>\n<p>- For Private restaurant, what exactly is included for $2500? My understanding from reading some old posts is:<\/p>\n<p>Dinner<\/p>\n<p>Open bar for 2 hours<\/p>\n<p>Private Venue<\/p>\n<p>Decorations for venue<\/p>\n<p>DJ\/Music\/Microphone for speeches????<\/p>\n<p>What is the max # of people included for 2500$ is it 40??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>THANK YOU IN ADVANCE <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kijijicoins@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.247.128.186","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1455551556,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"KJCoins","Id":286227,"Name":"KJCoins","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.181.193.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74d8b447c7f41e6e1d435bccca30861c","RawContent":"Soooo disappointed. Just received word from my travel agent that Transat (who we booked with) will not be flying from Alberta to Montego Bay in 2017 which means I likely will not be able to have the wedding I have already planned at the Bahia Pr\u00edncipe Runaway Bay :&#039;(","Attachments":[],"Id":1912880,"PostDate":1460712449,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Soooo disappointed. Just received word from my travel agent that Transat (who we booked with) will not be flying from Alberta to Montego Bay in 2017 which means I likely will not be able to have the wedding I have already planned at the Bahia Pr\u00edncipe Runaway Bay :'(\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sweetie_pie_06_18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.181.193.111","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452861563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285911.jpg?_r=1462160218","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Rosalyn","Id":285911,"Name":"Rosalyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.66.68.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53e13874d21d6c26a59c0392a540d0df","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Rosalyn\" post=\"1912880\" timestamp=\"1460730449\"]\nSoooo disappointed. Just received word from my travel agent that Transat (who we booked with) will not be flying from Alberta to Montego Bay in 2017 which means I likely will not be able to have the wedding I have already planned at the Bahia Pr\u00edncipe Runaway Bay :&#039;([\/quote]Oh no :( since they changed their flights I&#039;m assuming you can change your carrier with no issues? If yes can your TA find another carrier that does fly there during your wedding month? Good luck","Attachments":[],"Id":1912910,"PostDate":1460847621,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Rosalyn, on 15 April 2016 - 09:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Soooo disappointed. Just received word from my travel agent that Transat (who we booked with) will not be flying from Alberta to Montego Bay in 2017 which means I likely will not be able to have the wedding I have already planned at the Bahia Pr\u00edncipe Runaway Bay :'(<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nOh no <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> since they changed their flights I'm assuming you can change your carrier with no issues? If yes can your TA find another carrier that does fly there during your wedding month? Good luck \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.242.107.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac6882c016344dc94aa8bc16b6a7c330","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I need help, deciding whether or not to go for the Free or the unforgettable package. We are having a private reception at the pool side terrace with a buffet (ridiculously priced buffet for being all inclusive) plus we want a bar.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;we have approx 45 guest. Any suggestions would be greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914720,"PostDate":1467818270,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>I need help, deciding whether or not to go for the Free or the unforgettable package. We are having a private reception at the pool side terrace with a buffet (ridiculously priced buffet for being all inclusive) plus we want a bar.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>we have approx 45 guest. Any suggestions would be greatly appreciated.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nic_melt@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.172.45.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453204037,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nicmelt","Id":285957,"Name":"Nicmelt","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5565,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":5550,"NextPage":5560,"PreviousPage":5540,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
