{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68170,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5e14b443ac33a60e4b1afdef6bb0ade","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; WOW.. You did an amazing job!! :o) Now I must ask a silly question.. How did you cut the wrapping paper so perfect and insert it in the envelopes?.. I LOVE that!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1635399,"PostDate":1340762604,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> WOW.. You did an amazing job!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>) Now I must ask a silly question.. How did you cut the wrapping paper so perfect and insert it in the envelopes?.. I LOVE that!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britneyrasco@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1329430672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251499.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissBubbles205","Id":251499,"Name":"MissBubbles205","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68170,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40173334b8cb38466e61d44077417453","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks. &amp;nbsp;For the envelope liners:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1) I took a envelope and traced it on a piece of paper&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0685.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/876448\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2) I then used my eye to sketch the bottom of the stencil&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1635600,"PostDate":1340816703,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks. \u00a0For the envelope liners:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 1) I took a envelope and traced it on a piece of paper<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0685.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/876448\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 2) I then used my eye to sketch the bottom of the stencil<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chanteandrandall@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1300896434,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238077.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jazzysis","Id":238077,"Name":"jazzysis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68170,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e130f765b7230a4dab70f854fbd5894d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0686.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/876453\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3) Next i cut the wrapping paper into squares using a wrapping paper cutter&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 4) I then used the stencil to cut the liners&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 5) &amp;nbsp;i placed double sided tape inside the envelope and then attached everything&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; hope this helps&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1635604,"PostDate":1340816976,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0686.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/876453\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 3) Next i cut the wrapping paper into squares using a wrapping paper cutter<\/p> <p> 4) I then used the stencil to cut the liners\u00a0<\/p> <p> 5) \u00a0i placed double sided tape inside the envelope and then attached everything<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> hope this helps<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chanteandran