Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":65,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":14997,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1572885,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":225954,"Name":"ellie0717","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225954.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1327501668,"LastPoster":{"Id":285438,"Name":"jonesharry","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285438.png?_r=1456302282","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1572885,"PostDate":1327501668,"PostContent":"I posted this in \"DIY\" yesterday but thought I'd share it here as well...  \u00a0  We mailed our Save...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ellie@cprcontractors.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1267150969,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225954.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ellie0717","Id":225954,"Name":"ellie0717","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":6,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9063bd9e301c6e1ea921a7c15e6e19fc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I posted this in \"DIY\" yesterday but thought I&#039;d share it here as well...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We mailed our Save the Dates&amp;nbsp;two nights ago and we&#039;re&amp;nbsp;LOVING all the&amp;nbsp;calls, emails and texts from our family and friends already!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is a picture of the finished Save the Date before it was put in the envelope. They are magnets inside of a Kraft paper travel stamp Jacket tied with Bakers Twine and finished with a tag with our monogram on it. They were then placed in white envelopes with a Kraft Paper, wrap around address label.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/0c\/0c653590_2012SavetheDates068.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 068.JPG\" height=\"700\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/0c\/467x700px-LL-0c653590_2012SavetheDates068.jpeg\" width=\"467\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; No Bridal Sweatshop is complete with a couple of these in the afternoon (11 am but who&#039;s counting)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/bb\/bb9d4a4e_2012SavetheDates025.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"The afternoon (11 am) started out with a little of this...\" height=\"387\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/bb\/294x387px-LL-bb9d4a4e_2012SavetheDates025.jpeg\" style=\"width: 294px; height: 387px;\" width=\"258\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I stole the stamps from a template I got from a bride on here. I am so sorry I had her name saved so I could give her credit but I can&#039;t find it right now. However, THANK YOU SO MUCH!!! I changed the wording on the stamps around a little, then I used Picnik to create the Jackets. It took quite a bit of trial and error to get them to be the right size once cut down. I&#039;m sure that there would have been a better way to do this but Picnik was my only resource. Oh how I love it!!! When I showed my fiance the mock up I&#039;d made there were a bunch of markings in the inside that were for me to know lengths and widths and he got the idea to make a compass with longitudinal and latitudinal lines. I think it ended up super cute.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/09\/090b4dbe_2012SavetheDates030.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 030.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/09\/600x400px-LL-090b4dbe_2012SavetheDates030.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Below is the picnik picture of the cover:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/b6\/b672f649_OUTSIDEFINAL.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"OUTSIDE FINAL.jpg\" height=\"431\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/b6\/600x431px-LL-b672f649_OUTSIDEFINAL.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/e\/ea\/eaecbe42_INSIDEFINALWITHCUTLINES.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"INSIDE FINAL WITH CUT LINES.jpg\" height=\"466\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/e\/ea\/600x466px-LL-eaecbe42_INSIDEFINALWITHCUTLINES.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Above is the inside of the jacket with the cut lines. I made this in picnik as well and the printed it, drew the cut lines on it, scanned it and then reprinted it. Again, I&#039;m sure there would have been an easier way to do that but that&#039;s what I came up with.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Our Monogram was made by an etsy seller : &lt;img alt=\"Price5.jpg\" height=\"700\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/5\/5b\/522x700px-LL-5bd1aa31_Price5.jpeg\" width=\"522\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/db\/dbb24d15_2012SavetheDates032.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 032.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/db\/600x400px-LL-dbb24d15_2012SavetheDates032.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We used paper cutters and a martha stewart folding bone to \"shape\" the jackets.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/4a\/4a62a411_2012SavetheDates033.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 033.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/4a\/600x400px-LL-4a62a411_2012SavetheDates033.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/44\/4413e02e_2012SavetheDates036.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 036.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/44\/600x400px-LL-4413e02e_2012SavetheDates036.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I bought the envelopes from a wonderful amazon seller.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The address labels were from Kraft Outlet and I used a Martha Stewart template. After they were cut out I added the lace detail with a puncher from Michaels.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I stamped the back of the jackets with a stamp I bought at Michaels for $1.00. The white ink was around $7.00 though.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d3\/d38fc68b_2012SavetheDates042.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 042.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d3\/600x400px-LL-d38fc68b_2012SavetheDates042.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The Bakers Twine was also an Amazon find.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/8\/85\/8548cdc6_2012SavetheDates061.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 061.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/8\/85\/600x400px-LL-8548cdc6_2012SavetheDates061.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/46\/4675c953_2012SavetheDates070.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 070.JPG\" height=\"700\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/46\/467x700px-LL-4675c953_2012SavetheDates070.jpeg\" width=\"467\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/7\/73\/73425843_1.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"1.jpg\" height=\"240\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/7\/73\/320x240px-LL-73425843_1.jpeg\" width=\"320\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/6\/60\/60b0da57_2.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"2.jpg\" height=\"240\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/6\/60\/320x240px-LL-60b0da57_2.jpeg\" width=\"320\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/14\/14092f7d_3.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"3.jpg\" height=\"240\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/14\/320x240px-LL-14092f7d_3.jpeg\" width=\"320\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Lastly are the magnets. I once again used picnik to create the layout, added pictures and put text and shapes in to make the \"tag\" then I saved the file and uploaded it to VistaPrint. I bought 100 magnets at 50% off so I spent around $60.00 for all of them. It ended up to be a huge savings than if I&#039;d ordered them from another magnet store.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/44\/44370d5a_finalmagnet.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"final magnet.jpg\" height=\"700\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/44\/527x700px-LL-44370d5a_finalmagnet.jpeg\" width=\"527\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This project was a labor of love but as I&#039;ve stated in another post, I just LOVE that by doing a destination wedding I have so much extra time to work on these projects. I love the way they turned out and a HUGE thank you to all of you on this forum. I come here for inspiration all the time and get soooo much of it, it&#039;s almost overwhelming. Please let me know if you have any questions, I hope I can inspire another bride the way that so many of you have inspired me!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ellie&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572885,"PostDate":1327501668,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I posted this in \"DIY\" yesterday but thought I'd share it here as well...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We mailed our Save the Dates\u00a0two nights ago and we're\u00a0LOVING all the\u00a0calls, emails and texts from our family and friends already!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is a picture of the finished Save the Date before it was put in the envelope. They are magnets inside of a Kraft paper travel stamp Jacket tied with Bakers Twine and finished with a tag with our monogram on it. They were then placed in white envelopes with a Kraft Paper, wrap around address label.<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/0c\/0c653590_2012SavetheDates068.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 068.JPG\" height=\"700\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/0c\/467x700px-LL-0c653590_2012SavetheDates068.jpeg\" width=\"467\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> No Bridal Sweatshop is complete with a couple of these in the afternoon (11 am but who's counting)<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/bb\/bb9d4a4e_2012SavetheDates025.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"The afternoon (11 am) started out with a little of this...\" height=\"387\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/bb\/294x387px-LL-bb9d4a4e_2012SavetheDates025.jpeg\" style=\"width: 294px; height: 387px;\" width=\"258\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I stole the stamps from a template I got from a bride on here. I am so sorry I had her name saved so I could give her credit but I can't find it right now. However, THANK YOU SO MUCH!!! I changed the wording on the stamps around a little, then I used Picnik to create the Jackets. It took quite a bit of trial and error to get them to be the right size once cut down. I'm sure that there would have been a better way to do this but Picnik was my only resource. Oh how I love it!!! When I showed my fiance the mock up I'd made there were a bunch of markings in the inside that were for me to know lengths and widths and he got the idea to make a compass with longitudinal and latitudinal lines. I think it ended up super cute.<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/09\/090b4dbe_2012SavetheDates030.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 030.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/09\/600x400px-LL-090b4dbe_2012SavetheDates030.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> Below is the picnik picture of the cover:<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/b6\/b672f649_OUTSIDEFINAL.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"OUTSIDE FINAL.jpg\" height=\"431\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/b6\/600x431px-LL-b672f649_OUTSIDEFINAL.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/><\/span><\/a><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/e\/ea\/eaecbe42_INSIDEFINALWITHCUTLINES.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"INSIDE FINAL WITH CUT LINES.jpg\" height=\"466\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/e\/ea\/600x466px-LL-eaecbe42_INSIDEFINALWITHCUTLINES.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> Above is the inside of the jacket with the cut lines. I made this in picnik as well and the printed it, drew the cut lines on it, scanned it and then reprinted it. Again, I'm sure there would have been an easier way to do that but that's what I came up with.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Our Monogram was made by an etsy seller : <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Price5.jpg\" height=\"700\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/5\/5b\/522x700px-LL-5bd1aa31_Price5.jpeg\" width=\"522\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/db\/dbb24d15_2012SavetheDates032.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 032.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/db\/600x400px-LL-dbb24d15_2012SavetheDates032.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> We used paper cutters and a martha stewart folding bone to \"shape\" the jackets.<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/4a\/4a62a411_2012SavetheDates033.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 033.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/4a\/600x400px-LL-4a62a411_2012SavetheDates033.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/><\/span><\/a><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/44\/4413e02e_2012SavetheDates036.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 036.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/44\/600x400px-LL-4413e02e_2012SavetheDates036.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I bought the envelopes from a wonderful amazon seller.<\/p> <p> The address labels were from Kraft Outlet and I used a Martha Stewart template. After they were cut out I added the lace detail with a puncher from Michaels.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I stamped the back of the jackets with a stamp I bought at Michaels for $1.00. The white ink was around $7.00 though.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d3\/d38fc68b_2012SavetheDates042.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 042.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d3\/600x400px-LL-d38fc68b_2012SavetheDates042.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The Bakers Twine was also an Amazon find.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/8\/85\/8548cdc6_2012SavetheDates061.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 061.JPG\" height=\"400\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/8\/85\/600x400px-LL-8548cdc6_2012SavetheDates061.jpeg\" width=\"600\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/46\/4675c953_2012SavetheDates070.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2012 Save the Dates 070.JPG\" height=\"700\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/46\/467x700px-LL-4675c953_2012SavetheDates070.jpeg\" width=\"467\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/7\/73\/73425843_1.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"1.jpg\" height=\"240\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/7\/73\/320x240px-LL-73425843_1.jpeg\" width=\"320\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/6\/60\/60b0da57_2.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2.jpg\" height=\"240\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/6\/60\/320x240px-LL-60b0da57_2.jpeg\" width=\"320\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/14\/14092f7d_3.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"3.jpg\" height=\"240\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/14\/320x240px-LL-14092f7d_3.jpeg\" width=\"320\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> Lastly are the magnets. I once again used picnik to create the layout, added pictures and put text and shapes in to make the \"tag\" then I saved the file and uploaded it to VistaPrint. I bought 100 magnets at 50% off so I spent around $60.00 for all of them. It ended up to be a huge savings than if I'd ordered them from another magnet store.<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/44\/44370d5a_finalmagnet.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"final magnet.jpg\" height=\"700\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/44\/527x700px-LL-44370d5a_finalmagnet.jpeg\" width=\"527\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This project was a labor of love but as I've stated in another post, I just LOVE that by doing a destination wedding I have so much extra time to work on these projects. I love the way they turned out and a HUGE thank you to all of you on this forum. I come here for inspiration all the time and get soooo much of it, it's almost overwhelming. Please let me know if you have any questions, I hope I can inspire another bride the way that so many of you have inspired me!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ellie<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ellie@cprcontractors.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1267150969,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225954.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ellie0717","Id":225954,"Name":"ellie0717","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1fd3ebe83b9332a4cb693c7a7e1d11f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ellie,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Where did you get your kraft paper for the jackets and what size magnets are they from Vistaprint?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572934,"PostDate":1327506695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ellie,<\/p> <p> Where did you get your kraft paper for the jackets and what size magnets are they from Vistaprint?<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jamiecwilkie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"205.211.113.30","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1301676997,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238428.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":139,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"J and G 2012","Id":238428,"Name":"J and G 2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c5d86c97da1f7ffa341a785c98dbacf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I got the kraft paper from Michaels but the kraft labels for the envelopes from Kraft Outlet online.&amp;nbsp; The magnets are the large size.&amp;nbsp; All 3&amp;nbsp;vendors were awesome to work with :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572976,"PostDate":1327511512,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I got the kraft paper from Michaels but the kraft labels for the envelopes from Kraft Outlet online.\u00a0 The magnets are the large size.\u00a0 All 3\u00a0vendors were awesome to work with <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ellie@cprcontractors.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1267150969,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225954.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ellie0717","Id":225954,"Name":"ellie0717","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93598a81247cced55459d2f2515b5ed9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; They look amazing!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572981,"PostDate":1327511757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> They look amazing!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jkergen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.71.240","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1293159900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JayKay","Id":234788,"Name":"JayKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"885546c1cd1360f3e22750aa6fcb56a5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I looooove your STD cards!! Their so unique. Can you provide me some instructions on how to create the passport stamps? That is the last thing we need to do to finish off our passport invitations :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573947,"PostDate":1327632872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I looooove your STD cards!! Their so unique. Can you provide me some instructions on how to create the passport stamps? That is the last thing we need to do to finish off our passport invitations <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cynlee1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.90.223.87","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315768588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245173.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":120,"PhotoHeight":108,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cynlee143","Id":245173,"Name":"Cynlee143","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2feeb3768fd07eeea5dc0e5dfc76ec46","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Those are amazing! I am ashamed of my e-STD&#039;s that I whipped up in 15 min on pingg, haha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573954,"PostDate":1327633858,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Those are amazing! I am ashamed of my e-STD's that I whipped up in 15 min on pingg, haha.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299613406,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":fal